    "body": "- Tone Consistency: formal (\"Sie\", \"Ihre\") -> informal (\"Du\", \"deine\").\r\n- UI Vocabulary: \"Freund\" (e.g., Freundschaftsanfrage, Freundesliste, Freundeskreis) -> gender-neutral \"Kontakt\" equivalents (e.g., Kontaktanfrage, Kontaktliste, Kontaktgruppe).\r\n- Terminology: \"Gesprächsverlauf\" -> \"Chatverlauf\" (consistency, as the latter was used in 10, and the former in 5 places).\r\n- Corrected spacing errors around hyphens (e.g., \"Proxy-Adresse\" instead of \"Proxy -Adresse\") and improved literal translations coming out of the automated translation (e.g., \"tragbaren Modus\" -> \"portablen Modus\").\r\n\r\n<!-- Reviewable:start -->\r\n- - -\r\nThis change is [<img src=\"https://reviewable.io/review_button.svg\" height=\"34\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"Reviewable\"/>](https://reviewable.io/reviews/TokTok/qTox/659)\r\n<!-- Reviewable:end -->\r\n",
