                    "name": "iphydf"
                },
                "message": "docs(i18n): Improve German translation consistency and UI strings.\n\n- Tone Consistency: formal (\"Sie\", \"Ihre\") -> informal (\"Du\", \"deine\").\n- UI Vocabulary: \"Freund\" (e.g., Freundschaftsanfrage, Freundesliste,\n  Freundeskreis) -> gender-neutral \"Kontakt\" equivalents (e.g.,\n  Kontaktanfrage, Kontaktliste, Kontaktgruppe).\n- Terminology: \"Gesprächsverlauf\" -> \"Chatverlauf\" (consistency, as the\n  latter was used in 10, and the former in 5 places).\n- Corrected spacing errors around hyphens (e.g., \"Proxy-Adresse\" instead\n  of \"Proxy -Adresse\") and improved literal translations coming out of\n  the automated translation (e.g., \"tragbaren Modus\" -> \"portablen\n  Modus\").",
                "tree": {
                    "sha": "8215fbf621583f30f721f1f9a7f9da2dc1a66c66",
                    "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/TokTok/qTox/git/trees/8215fbf621583f30f721f1f9a7f9da2dc1a66c66"
                },
                "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/TokTok/qTox/git/commits/0d9663722b79760367cb2197a1ea2c526f35246e",
                "verification": {
                    "payload": "tree 8215fbf621583f30f721f1f9a7f9da2dc1a66c66\nparent dc09cbb7fe7d8ab3d4b8e27c699d99eb3258071f\nauthor iphydf <iphydf@users.noreply.github.com> 1771352038 +0000\ncommitter iphydf <iphydf@users.noreply.github.com> 1771415073 +0000\n\ndocs(i18n): Improve German translation consistency and UI strings.\n\n- Tone Consistency: formal (\"Sie\", \"Ihre\") -> informal (\"Du\", \"deine\").\n- UI Vocabulary: \"Freund\" (e.g., Freundschaftsanfrage, Freundesliste,\n  Freundeskreis) -> gender-neutral \"Kontakt\" equivalents (e.g.,\n  Kontaktanfrage, Kontaktliste, Kontaktgruppe).\n- Terminology: \"Gesprächsverlauf\" -> \"Chatverlauf\" (consistency, as the\n  latter was used in 10, and the former in 5 places).\n- Corrected spacing errors around hyphens (e.g., \"Proxy-Adresse\" instead\n  of \"Proxy -Adresse\") and improved literal translations coming out of\n  the automated translation (e.g., \"tragbaren Modus\" -> \"portablen\n  Modus\").\n",
